dkit quickstart: Create a template DataKit package

USAGE

    $ dkit quickstart [PKG [WHERE]] [OPTIONS]

ARGUMENTS

    PKG: Name of Python package relative to WHERE
    WHERE: Create package in folder WHERE

OPTIONS

    -h, --help
        Print this help message and exit

    --target, -t TARGET
        Use TARGET as a prefix to the package name PKG

    --title TITLE
        Use TITLE as one-line description for the package

    --where WHERE
        Create package in folder WHERE
